  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759247,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10101 - Will the Starship (PlayStation) - Synopsis\n\nEmbark on an epic spacefaring adventure in *10101 - Will the Starship*, a unique blend of tactical RPG and thrilling space combat for the PlayStation. As the newly appointed captain of the Space Battleship *Will*, your mission is to defeat the enigmatic Keasu and navigate the perils of deep space. \n\nThis immersive experience features a compelling narrative rich with romance, talent, and dramatic character arcs, brought to life by full voice acting from a stellar cast including Kyoko Hikami and Ishida Akira.  \n\nGameplay revolves around strategic ship management and intense real-time battles where you’ll command your crew and utilize tactical maneuvers to overcome challenging enemies.  Promote your crew, develop their skills, and forge relationships as you lead the *Will* on a perilous journey.  Experience a captivating story, stunning visuals, and engaging gameplay that will test your leadership and strategic prowess in this unforgettable space opera."
    },
